{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922810/extras/74971c4700ef2c2c7d14f9c1983d92a8.avif?t=1765895690\" width=940 height=256 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure Shinty is a sports simulation game for the Scottish Game &quot;Shinty&quot; (Gaelic: &quot;Camanachd&quot;)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shinty is a traditional Scottish game played mostly in the Highlands, Islands and across Scotland with strong roots and connections with the Irish game Hurling. This game aims to capture the pace, exitment and brutality of the sport.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently in development and this page is subject to change and updates</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Demo Features</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 teams to choose from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic 1v1 games, local co-op, singleplayer or Steam Remote Play Together</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 minute game lengths - 2.5 minute halves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized player names and gear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited music playlist</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Multiplayer</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play against your friends locally or via Steam remote play together! (online coming soon)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Formation Editing</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select or create a custom team formation to perform the best tactics!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Featuring Scottish Music</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Artists/Bands from across Scotland have contributed music for the menus and other areas in the game, showcasing their talent in a unique medium!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Custom Players </u></strong>(Coming soon)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and customize a player, add them to a team.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Training </u></strong>(Coming soon)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train players to improve their stats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922810/extras/cc5b18be6aba25999c8a0f332fa38d03.avif?t=1765895690\" width=940 height=256 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3922810?t=1765895690","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922810/ecb0db4a96b865a7bf1253e50729ee6e247f1d7e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765895690","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922810/8189224df765f63e007dd43beea4c956f3ec79ed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765895690","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922810/8189224df765f63e007dd43beea4c956f3ec79ed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765895690","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4089350,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922810/extras/74971c4700ef2c2c7d14f9c1983d92a8.avif?t=1765895690\" width=940 height=256 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure Shinty is a sports simul